      "window": "11/10/2024 – 12/09/2024",
      "posted_purchases_total": "$7,235.26",
      "short_by": "$264.74"
    },
    "notes": [
      "Only posted purchases count (authorized-user and virtual-card purchases count). Fees, interest, cash advances, balance transfers, and unresolved disputed transactions are excluded.",
      "A single month below the threshold disqualifies the entire cardmember year (no partial or prorated rebate)."
    ]
  },
  "options_next_steps": [
    "If you’d like, I can produce a full month-by-month breakdown for that cardmember year so you can see each window’s posted total.",
    "I can check earlier cardmember years (e.g., 11/10/2023–11/09/2024) if you want me to confirm whether you earned a rebate previously.",
    "If you believe a posted transaction is missing or should be included (or you want a human to review this decision), I can transfer you to a human agent. Would you like me to do that?"
  ]
}
